# local design prototypes (not shipped)
#
# The contents rather than the directory: git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent DIRECTORY is excluded, so `public/_proto/` followed by a negation
# silently does nothing. This form works.
public/_proto/*
# ...except the probe. It has to live under public/ to be loadable by URL, and
# it carries four rounds of instrumentation lessons that cost more to learn
# than the bugs they were looking for. See docs/spec.md section 8.
!public/_proto/probe.js
